{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"8339865fa4e780875e6e1e53719a96d041257507b92f6a0686abb4f1c16a595c","ja":"ふさわしい部屋","zh":"合适的房间","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b0c6b33d5f5543b952b22529d1b9fda2fb72e89c26262d83ddc3bbb7e0e57f23","ja":"はぁはぁ……、遅くなってごめんなさい！","zh":"呼……呼……，对不起我来晚了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"39772ae4104c72275027a4e49a391912dd4c36c3d9a0d46805accd70e143f400","ja":"律っちゃん、お疲れ～。\nまだ亜美たちしか来てないから大丈夫だよ。","zh":"律子，辛苦啦～。\n现在还只有亚美她们到了，所以没关系哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d8b9effb115aece3284cfea2c99f02b46b1d5e98a8bf33ba89a95c70224fab8d","ja":"ゆーっくりストレッチして待ってたから\n問題ナッシングだよ！","zh":"我都好好做完拉伸等着了，\n完全没问题哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b7eb5f90d676b5df1189ec50caf7b0cb1ae14cc3ab23e8181c25fc358ae9c039","ja":"それなら良かったけど……。\nって、この部屋、なんだか変じゃないかしら？","zh":"那就好……\n不过，这个房间是不是有点奇怪？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5199674c67a45abd214d4fa590af2e18269fcf71ed3232fabfdcba31a50f137c","ja":"え～？\n亜美は別になんとも思わないけどな～。","zh":"诶～？\n亚美倒是觉得没什么啦～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"1e6298c9846e14a760e7042ad1d1d30bacb39c6bc82a335f3325beec35b538c6","ja":"いいえ、やっぱりおかしいわ、暑すぎるわよ！\nいくら急いできたからって。","zh":"不对，果然很奇怪，这也太热了吧！\n就算走得再急也不至于这样。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b325ea9eb2215d0dcbe734b6fa220476222495a045620d586d1ed14d3c723daa","ja":"エアコンの不調かしら……？","zh":"是空调出故障了吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"c29ef39d7c477ecf2432486e564ecd80704f7f356e453c51cf7f0aaaabcb0cf0","ja":"ふっふっふ。気づいたかね、律っちゃん。\nこの暑さは……真美たちが燃えているからなんだよ！","zh":"哼哼哼。你注意到了吗，小律子。\n这股热意……是因为真美她们正燃烧着热情呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"dd95469bb0bbe1cef6d4a802346e9882497e2b55245df5ae57431b9f6b050d84","ja":"そう、まさに太陽のように！　きっとエアコンも、\n亜美たちの気持ちに応えてくれてるんだよ！","zh":"对，简直就像太阳一样！空调也一定\n是在回应亚美她们的心意呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"1693e39e31d30d95a78bc71b39e41114e1153c3fd3002642d7bf267b37a2b703","ja":"なに言ってるのよ、そんなわけ……。","zh":"你在说什么呢，怎么可能会……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"06ecf064442b52322bd4f1efdb70a081a7eaa52a61143479abf50e506bffded6","ja":"（さては、イタズラでやったわね。\nそれなら……）","zh":"（看来是故意恶作剧的呢。\n既然这样的话……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f5ec6240cb443a47e240d89f42efa03636e13b07b6785fed669fc0c84a412f04","ja":"そうね。たしかに今のレッスンルームは\n私たちにピッタリみたいだわ！","zh":"也是呢。现在的练习室\n确实很适合我们呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d87c3cf02780d9fa5a31bac9fc5010cef361815efce7e6366136f9d8ed669e1d","ja":"でしょでしょ？　分かってるね～、律っちゃん。","zh":"对吧对吧？律子很懂嘛～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"984e0e5d234b36f7fc37eac11ef0981a3549fdb1f721b631290480e5c8513f60","ja":"ええ。それじゃあこの熱が冷めないうちに、\nさっさとレッスンを始めましょうか♪","zh":"好。那就趁着这份热情还没冷却，\n赶快开始练习吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1378.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"02499558c657d7f18e784361710518eb8687c9566a0dc0258f6ff49c924b5a18","ja":"……ええ～っ！\nこのままこの部屋でやるの～！？","zh":"……诶诶～！\n就在这个房间里直接弄吗～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
